# Auto-push to GitHub

After making portfolio website edits for Fangzhuo, commit and push to GitHub when the work is complete — unless the user explicitly says not to push.

- Only commit files related to the current task.
- Do not commit secrets, `.env`, or `desktop.ini`.
- Use clear commit messages focused on why the change was made.
- Run `git push` after a successful commit so `main` stays in sync with Vercel.
